{"il_d22e8fae":"img/x/a31ce729417c27ed.mp3","il_f751446a":"img/x/4744f6eb43459e67.mp3","il_86a9546f":"img/x/bb99a855bb9c6aea.mp3","il_69cd66e7":"img/x/f90f8a37f12bfc2d.mp3","il_8030c778":"img/x/17b1fda09023f508.mp3","il_1cedd04e":"img/x/60e4901d8046c2e6.mp3","il_ffdbb650":"img/x/a2be3bd5a29a15b5.mp3","il_8c5a471d":"img/x/78239f7fc93f0dce.mp3","il_c7f86909":"img/x/8c74d07563a601ef.mp3","il_9d82f44b":"img/x/e2c8c45e05ffbda3.mp3","il_aa9288a7":"img/x/1339103ef729f3f4.mp3","il_2a4ae799":"img/x/3799f892ee32c9ac.mp3","il_4da845b5":"img/x/d828eaf05a7bd0fb.mp3","il_824f3da7":"img/x/ae5ae6ae282f63c9.mp3","il_d45db7d5":"img/x/748d005b68e9972f.mp3","il_e14871ae":"img/x/4854a2af6f5767a8.mp3","il_5bda3998":"img/x/616b81c244b963de.mp3","il_d97b453d":"img/x/d0a126fddabba010.mp3","il_495808b0":"img/x/af8d03a1e52a88fe.mp3","il_d0ac8150":"img/x/d92f97fecb992e40.mp3","il_bce93973":"img/x/d79650525d5a30d5.mp3","il_ee39f089":"img/x/d7b2dda6ca05528c.mp3","il_0d8f5083":"img/x/06a70e126c4ed746.mp3","il_c879aee3":"img/x/156777e4aaf34c24.mp3","il_b720f9c8":"img/x/7d80955de9ec75aa.mp3","il_2a736c68":"img/x/77af2540de52edd3.mp3","il_081a5ad0":"img/x/99c0610af8121f78.mp3","il_9b8fd138":"img/x/dee965074a390a2e.mp3","il_0d38dd77":"img/x/4d64636fad147660.mp3","il_dfcc6dff":"img/x/a07e7ce765a512c6.mp3","il_3531b1be":"img/x/df16a42c6b91377a.mp3","il_4adf8de5":"img/x/c307b1f39798ef15.mp3","il_a47e4667":"img/x/cacd6a1f73864a4c.mp3","il_88d290fa":"img/x/3feee869c9afb1f5.mp3","il_b3e6c3bf":"img/x/862c28ebb11f2107.mp3","il_fff9fbc3":"img/x/ab75eecd20418037.mp3","il_2f2a7e09":"img/x/0d4aafe57675fb2a.mp3","il_e568b7f8":"img/x/72e5069a351eee63.mp3","il_f97076e7":"img/x/4ecc207e5b1bf1f4.mp3","il_60e1e1f0":"img/x/885e2e6faa6315a5.mp3","il_37c6e307":"img/x/2673ef9fcaefb643.mp3","il_6cd6b877":"img/x/b09315efae777c79.mp3","il_9cd5484a":"img/x/4ebe2f80eb4ec7cb.mp3","il_576e9cf8":"img/x/2351344640105a75.mp3","il_cc34d9d9":"img/x/d654874c4b249c5a.mp3","il_c6807a19":"img/x/5fb898b947dde104.mp3","il_fdf6af11":"img/x/6ff9a8f05baf84d0.mp3","il_ab96237f":"img/x/8c704d2dca01bdb0.mp3","il_5e17783c":"img/x/73fe7410b37d2b85.mp3","il_6a7df283":"img/x/efe6621398a01f40.mp3","il_45a26bb1":"img/x/2a189b3d37c06eb9.mp3","il_fe6132cd":"img/x/4d6e510627e0ce4c.mp3","il_9d405073":"img/x/314cccdfc9dbe173.mp3","il_6d4a25f3":"img/x/c32289060b0057dc.mp3","il_dceec41c":"img/x/d31f4d5b3afd9bdf.mp3","il_0f42d51e":"img/x/5d69291efd4d15ac.mp3","il_4856dcd6":"img/x/dc5a4b4f519d7c9a.mp3","il_74fb2897":"img/x/5b59d4f5ba59dbae.mp3","il_f38ac362":"img/x/57c98ae26f5146e6.mp3","il_f846f033":"img/x/e1bd55fd72f52652.mp3","v_ilsabet":"img/x/d3c712d30954a8d7.mp3","__lines":{"Fresh oath, fresh boots. The druids test everyone who wants through. Lose, and you walk around. It\u2019s a long way around.":"il_d22e8fae","The Ember Court pays its heralds by the head. Yours is worth more than you\u2019d like.":"il_f751446a","Don\u2019t hum along. I mean it. The last Hunter who hummed is still here. Third row.":"il_86a9546f","The Coven\u2019s bell-tower is in there, if you look from the right side of the hour.":"il_69cd66e7","The Tinker-Lord sells everything. The price is always a duel, and he always knows the price.":"il_8030c778","Whatever hurts here, hurts us both. That isn\u2019t poetry. Pace yourself.":"il_1cedd04e","Velkan doesn\u2019t want the Gate for himself. He wants it for the sky. Somehow that\u2019s worse.":"il_ffdbb650","Keep moving. Skadira\u2019s people freeze anything that stands still long enough to be counted.":"il_8c5a471d","If you hear a bell under the water, don\u2019t answer it.":"il_c7f86909","Silver bells. Locked shutters. A squire with very good teeth. I\u2019m sleeping in my boots.":"il_9d82f44b","Four Relics. One Key in the mouth of a hungry star. We take it back, or nobody takes anything back ever again.":"il_aa9288a7","Whatever happens, I\u2019m right behind you. Five steps. Don\u2019t trip.":"il_2a4ae799","The Debt Collectors put these up. Sign, and they give you coin for your trouble. They always give you coin first.":"il_4da845b5","Well. Now you\u2019re on the books.":"il_824f3da7","Smart. Never sign anything bigger than you are.":"il_d45db7d5","That\u2019s a Bailiff. She doesn\u2019t bluff. I\u2019ve checked.":"il_e14871ae","Every coin, sure. And every debt that comes with it.":"il_5bda3998","Don\u2019t look at me like that. Hunters hunt. There\u2019s a sealed case down here and I can\u2019t lift the lid alone.":"il_d97b453d","\u2026Right. Noted, Hunter.":"il_495808b0","Quiet night. Here, your cut. You\u2019re cheaper than a guard dog and you complain less.":"il_d0ac8150","Don\u2019t answer it.":"il_bce93973","So you\u2019re the new one. Ilsabet. I find things, then I sell them to people like you.":"il_ee39f089","Every card you play costs pages off your own deck. Out here it costs gold too. The map\u2019s yours. Try not to die on it.":"il_0d8f5083","Morning. You look less dead. Go spend it.":"il_c879aee3","She blew up her own bridge to make a point. I like her already.":"il_b720f9c8","Sable. She\u2019s good. She\u2019s also never once finished a job without stabbing somebody in the back.":"il_2a736c68","She\u2019s going to be impossible now.":"il_081a5ad0","Don\u2019t. It\u2019s my debt. I sold my future for my first map, and every Relic since has paid down the interest. I\u2019ll finish paying it.":"il_f97076e7","You\u2026 paid it. All of it. I don\u2019t know what to say. That\u2019s a first.":"il_60e1e1f0","\u2026Right. Of course. Everyone keeps the page.":"il_37c6e307","I\u2019m\u2026 not in the Ledger. I\u2019m not in anything. Hunter, I owe you. No, wait. I don\u2019t owe anybody. Ha!":"il_6cd6b877","You can\u2019t talk to that. I mean you can. It won\u2019t care.":"il_9cd5484a","Some things you can\u2019t talk to. Good to know which.":"il_576e9cf8","The Lantern of Unpaid Light. I thought it was a story. It\u2019s a very pretty story.":"il_cc34d9d9","Welcome to the Low Road. Everything down here is for sale, and everything down here is already owed.":"il_9b8fd138","Thin air, rich people, long drops. My three favorite things.":"il_0d38dd77","The Lantern Isles. I always thought these were a story. I\u2019m very glad I was wrong.":"il_dfcc6dff","I hate sewers. Sewers hate me back. It\u2019s mutual and it\u2019s healthy.":"il_3531b1be","Last time they sang. This time they\u2019re humming. Humming is worse.":"il_4adf8de5","Remember when this was a forest? Me neither, apparently.":"il_a47e4667","If the second bell rings for you, don\u2019t say \u201chere\u201d.":"il_88d290fa","Something down here is asleep. Let\u2019s keep our voices down. And our cards up.":"il_c6807a19","Don\u2019t touch anything that\u2019s spinning. Everything is spinning.":"il_fdf6af11","We said we wouldn\u2019t answer it. We\u2019re about to answer it, aren\u2019t we.":"il_ab96237f","Don\u2019t look at the mirrors. Or do. I look great in them.":"il_5e17783c","Not my page anymore. I can breathe in here now.":"il_6a7df283","If I go quiet in there, it\u2019s not because I\u2019m scared. It\u2019s because I\u2019m reading.":"il_45a26bb1","Breathe through your sleeve. Breathe through my sleeve. Just don\u2019t breathe through yours.":"il_fe6132cd","Smile. Bow. Don\u2019t eat anything with a cherry on it.":"il_9d405073","A bride who married a fire. I\u2019ve had worse dates. Not many.":"il_6d4a25f3","When the horns stop, run. Don\u2019t ask which way. Just run.":"il_dceec41c","They read the future up here. I hope ours is in a good font.":"il_0f42d51e","Valkyries. They choose who lives. Let\u2019s look alive.":"il_4856dcd6","Witches. Pretty ones. That\u2019s always worse.":"il_74fb2897","The Rat King. Don\u2019t bow. He\u2019ll take it as a menu.":"il_b3e6c3bf","Hold onto something. Hold onto me. No, not like that.":"il_fff9fbc3","Last door before the Gate. Knock politely. Then knock hard.":"il_2f2a7e09","Five steps behind you. Like I promised. Except now I\u2019m doing it for free.":"il_e568b7f8","\u2026I\u2019m here. You still have my page. I\u2019m still here.":"il_f38ac362","Five steps behind you. Like I promised.":"il_f846f033"}}